{
 "annotations": {
  "destructiveHint": false,
  "idempotentHint": true,
  "openWorldHint": false,
  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "Freight Identifier Validator"
 },
 "description": "Validate and parse freight identifiers by their public check-digit algorithms: shipping container numbers (ISO 6346), air waybill (AWB) numbers (IATA modulus-7) and IMO ship identification numbers.\n\nTwo modes: pass text=<arbitrary string> to find and validate every identifier in it (e.g. a booking-email line), OR pass value=<identifier> + type=<container|awb|imo> to validate one.\n\nBehavior: deterministic check-digit arithmetic; per identifier found it reports type, the normalised form, valid (pass/fail), expected vs actual check digit, and details (container: owner prefix + equipment category; AWB: airline prefix + the operating airline resolved from the AWB-prefix dataset; IMO: the 7-digit number); text mode with no identifiers found returns an empty found[] with a note. Rate-limited (anonymous use: 25 requests/day per IP): a 429 error body carries retry_after_seconds and a Retry-After header \u2014 back off and retry, or call get_subscribe_link for higher limits.\n\nReturns: found[] (each entry with its own _source naming the standard applied) and disclaimer under result, plus confidence, _source and citation (the FreightUtils v1 response envelope).\n\nLimitations: STRUCTURAL ONLY \u2014 a valid check digit means well-formed, NOT that the container, shipment or vessel exists or is active; not a registry or tracking lookup.\n\nRelated: container_lookup (container TYPE specs, not numbers), airline_lookup (the AWB-prefix dataset the airline resolution uses).",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "text": {
    "description": "Arbitrary string to scan for container / AWB / IMO identifiers (parse mode). Provide this OR value+type. Example: \"2 cntrs MSKU3068808 / TGHU7654325 on AWB 176-12345675\".",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "type": {
    "description": "Identifier type for value: container = ISO 6346, awb = IATA air waybill, imo = IMO ship number.",
    "enum": [
     "container",
     "awb",
     "imo"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   },
   "value": {
    "description": "A single identifier to validate (typed mode). Requires type. Example: \"MSKU3068808\".",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "validate",
